                <opener><seg rendition="#center">No. 325.</seg></opener>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <head>Mr. Fish to General
                        Sickles</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State</hi>, <hi
                                rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1870-10-10"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >October</hi> 10, 1870.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sickles</hi>, <hi rendition="#italic">Minister</hi>,
                        <hi rendition="#italic">Madrid:</hi></p>
                <p>The conditions of the proposed arbitration mentioned in your telegram are
                    entirely objectionable, and cannot be admitted. You characterize them
                    properly.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>FISH.</signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
